#### From mathcomp Require Import all_ssreflect all_algebra. From mathcomp Require Import reals geometry euclidean. Set Implicit Arguments. Unset Strict Implicit.Unset Printing Implicit Defensive. Section GeometryTheorem. Variable R : realType. Variables A B C D F G : 'rV[R]_2. Hypotheses Hsq: dist A B = dist B C /\dist B C = dist C D /\dist C D = dist D A /\angle A B C = PI/2 /\angle B C D = PI/2 /\angle C D A = PI/2 /\angle D A B = PI/2. Hypothesis HFM: F = (A + D) / 2. Hypothesis HGperp: exists k, G = D + k *: (C - D) /\'[F-G,C-D]=0. Hypothesis HBint: exists t1 t2, B = A + t1 *: (C - A) /\B = F + t2 *: (G - F). Theorem compute_GB: G = B. Proof. by []. Qed. End GeometryTheorem.
